// ═══════════════════════════════  STRATEGY  ═════════════════════════════
// What to do about it: entry, stop, target, size. The layer that turns a
// signal into an order, and the only one the indicator does not share.
//
// It reads setupObj for the region in play and signalFired for the moment.
// Several strategies could sit on the same setup and the same signal and
// differ only in the management, which is why that boundary is kept.
//
// Empty on purpose. A strategy with no orders still compiles and still
// draws the model, which is what makes it worth looking at before there
// are any rules.
